--swiftversion 6.0
--indent 4
--maxwidth 100
# Keep `{` on the wrapped line, not its own, so it agrees with swiftlint's opening_brace rule; docComments off so policy `//` comments aren't auto-promoted to `///`. wrapIfStatementBodies (default-on since 0.62) off to keep terse single-line guards.
--disable wrapMultilineStatementBraces,docComments,wrapIfStatementBodies
--exclude .build,DerivedData
